text = "A shimmering blue liquid swirls in this small glass vial, humming faintly with arcane energy. Brewed by guild alchemists using rare herbs and crystal dust, it restores a portion of the drinker's magical reserves. Favored by mages and spellcasters before delving into ancient ruins or confronting arcane beasts, its effect is quick but temporary. Handle with care. 
Excess consumption may cause magical instability.
"
